text_01F8:
    string "I'll make it a silver world, yuki"  ; ja: 白銀の世界にしてやるゆきー

text_0213:
    string "I'm going to the northern country,%Kyuki ★"  ; ja: 北の国に行くんだゆきー★

text_022C:
    string "I roll and get bigger, yuki ♪"  ; ja: 転がって大きくなるゆきー♪

text_0247:
    string "The northern country is right%Kahead, yuki ♭"  ; ja: 北の国は目の前だゆきー♭

text_0260:
    string "A big cold wave is coming, yuki ♪"  ; ja: 大寒波襲来だゆきー♪

text_0275:
    string "The world is turning pure white,%Kyuki ★"  ; ja: 世界が真っ白になってくゆきー★

text_0294:
    string "This is the dry-ice effect, yuki!"  ; ja: これがドライアイス効果だゆきー！

text_02B5:
    string "It's been cold lately so I'm%Kin top shape, yuki ★"  ; ja: ここんとこ寒かったから調子が%K最高だゆきー★

text_02E2:
    string "I'll stay in 1st place for a%Kwhile, yuki ★"  ; ja: しばらく１位にいてあげるゆき★

text_0301:
    string "I feel like I'm melting, yukiii ≦"  ; ja: なんか溶けちゃいそうゆき～≦

text_031E:
    string "The freezer is broken, yuki ∵"  ; ja: 冷凍庫が故障だゆきー∵

text_0335:
    string "Huh? My eyes slipped out of place,%Kyuki ≦"  ; ja: ありゃ？%K目の位置がずれちゃったゆき≦

text_035C:
    string "If I go to that store%KI'll melt in an instant, yuki ≦"  ; ja: お店に行ったら%K一瞬で溶けちゃうゆきー≦

text_0385:
    string "There's a store where no snow%Kfalls, yuki ≦"  ; ja: 雪の降ってないお店があるゆき≦

text_03A4:
    string "A dangerous atmosphere....%Kyuki ≦≦"  ; ja: 危険な雰囲気・・・・ゆき～≦≦

text_03C3:
    string "Hot-looking places are bunched%Ktogether, yuki ≦"  ; ja: 暑そうな所が集中してるゆきー≦

text_03E2:
    string "Big stores are against the rules,%Kyuki"  ; ja: おっきなお店は反則だゆき～

text_03FD:
    string "At this rate I'll really melt,%Kyuki"  ; ja: このままじゃほんとに溶けちゃうゆき

text_0420:
    string "I'll make it snow on the store%Kthat's taking a break, yuki ♪"  ; ja: お休み中のお店には%K雪を降らしちゃうゆき♪

text_044B:
    string "Taking a break, yuki ♪"       ; ja: お休み中ゆきー♪

text_045C:
    string "My chance has come, yuki ♭"   ; ja: チャンスが来たゆき♭

text_0471:
    string "The goods are gone, yuki ≦"   ; ja: 品物がなくなってるゆきー≦

text_048C:
    string "If they don't restock they'll get%Kmelted, yuki ≦"  ; ja: 補充しなくちゃ溶かされちゃうゆき≦

text_04AF:
    string "I forgot to restock, yuki ≦"  ; ja: 仕入れをしとくの忘れてたゆき≦

text_04CE:
    string "With my pay%KI'll stock up on dry ice, yuki ♭"  ; ja: お給料で%Kドライアイスを買い込むゆきー♭

text_04F7:
    string "Now I can catch my breath, yuki ★"  ; ja: これで一息つけるゆきー★

text_0510:
    string "The cat curls up under the%Kkotatsu, yuki ★"  ; ja: ねこはこたつで丸くなってるゆき★

text_0531:
    string "Snowball fight, GO! yuki ★"   ; ja: 雪合戦ＧＯ！だゆき★

text_0546:
    string "I want to go skiing, yuki ♪"  ; ja: スキーがやりたいゆき♪

text_055D:
    string "I want to live in the Arctic,%Kyuki ★"  ; ja: 北極圏に住みたいゆき★

text_0574:
    string "It's getting kind of hot, yuki ≦"  ; ja: なんか暑くなってきたゆき≦

text_058F:
    string "My body's melting drip by drip,%Kyuki ≦"  ; ja: ぽたぽた体が溶けてるゆき～≦

text_05AC:
    string "I want to go back to snow country,%Kyuki ≦≦"  ; ja: 雪国に帰りたいゆき≦≦

text_05C3:
    string "Can I stand it, yuki?"        ; ja: 耐えられそうゆき？

text_05D6:
    string "I'll shop till it's sold out,%Kyuki!"  ; ja: 買い物して品切れにしてやるゆき！

text_05F7:
    string "Big stores don't scare me, yuki"  ; ja: 大きな店なんてこわくないゆき

text_0614:
    string "I'll buy a store and run the air%Kconditioner full blast, yuki ♪"  ; ja: お店買ってクーラー全開だゆき♪

text_0633:
    string "Free stores go to whoever's first,%Kyuki ★"  ; ja: フリーお店は早い者勝ちだゆき★

text_0652:
    string "I'll get covered in snow, yuki ★"  ; ja: 雪まみれになっちゃうゆき★

text_066D:
    string "If I buy that%KI'll turn into water, yuki ∵"  ; ja: あんなの買ったら%K水になっちゃうゆき～∵

text_0696:
    string "Expensive goods%Kare none of my business, yuki!"  ; ja: 高い品物なんか%K知ったことじゃないゆき！

text_06BF:
    string "Could it be...%K%NMY is losing, yuki?"  ; ja: もしかして・・・%K%NMYって負けてるゆき？

text_06E8:
    string "I want to refill my money, yuki"  ; ja: お金を補充したいゆき

text_06FD:
    string "The bank belongs to everyone,%Kyuki ★"  ; ja: 銀行ってみんなのものゆき★

text_0718:
    string "Is payday coming up soon, yuki?"  ; ja: 給料日ってそろそろだったかゆき？

text_0739:
    string "There's no snow at all around%Khere, yuki ≦"  ; ja: このへん雪が全然ないゆき≦

text_0754:
    string "It's strangely hot around here,%Kyuki ∵"  ; ja: この辺みょーに暑いゆき～∥｜∵

text_0773:
    string "No snow piled up.... yuki ≦"  ; ja: 雪がつもってない・・・・ゆき≦

text_0792:
    string "The basics of a store is%Krestocking, yuki ♭"  ; ja: お店の基本は仕入れだゆき♭

text_07AD:
    string "Making money starts with%Krestocking, yuki ♪"  ; ja: お金もうけは補充からだゆき♪

text_07CA:
    string "Preparing to intercept with luxury%Kgoods, yuki ★"  ; ja: 高級品で迎撃準備だゆき★

text_07E3:
    string "Which way is the better deal,%Kyuki?"  ; ja: どっちに行ったら得かゆき？

text_07FE:
    string "Which way is cold, yuki?"     ; ja: 寒いのはどっちだゆき？

text_0815:
    string "Which way is north, yuki?"    ; ja: 北はどっちの方だゆき？

text_082C:
    string "I feel like changing direction,%Kyuki ★"  ; ja: 方向転換したくなってきたゆき★

text_084B:
    string "I want to go speedily, yuki ♪"  ; ja: スピーディーに行きたいゆき♪

text_0868:
    string "Turn up the air conditioner,%Kyuki ♭"  ; ja: クーラーを強くしておくれだゆき♭

text_0889:
    string "Winter is good, yuki"         ; ja: ふゆがいいゆき

text_0898:
    string "Thanks for having me, yuki"   ; ja: おそまつさまゆき

text_08A9:
    string "Yukki ya konkon (snow song)..."  ; ja: ゆっきやコンコン・・・
